import ../../site/games/farm/scene_landscape.dl
import ../../site/games/farm/scene_weather.dl

require condition ((the absolute value of ((the website Farm rain height from 4.0 at 0.1 seconds) - 3.3)) < 0.00001) reporting "Rain did not fall at seven world units per second"
require condition ((the absolute value of ((the website Farm rain height from 0.5 at 0.1 seconds) - 8.8)) < 0.00001) reporting "Rain did not wrap below the ground"
require condition ((the absolute value of ((the website Farm rain height from 4.0 at (9.0 / 7.0) seconds) - 4.0)) < 0.00001) reporting "A rain cycle did not return to its initial height"
set world to the initial website farm world
set landscape to a website Farm landscape for world
set count to the length of (landscape's objects)
set weather to website Farm weather in landscape
require condition ((the length of (landscape's objects)) = count + 1) reporting "Rain must be one retained cloud object"
require condition ((weather's object's visible = false) and (weather's object's pickable = false)) reporting "Clear skies exposed rain geometry or intercepted picking"
set part to the item at 0 in (weather's object's instance's model's parts)
set base to a UI cylinder mesh with top 1.0 bottom 1.0 height 1.0 around 6 sides capped true
require condition ((the length of part's mesh's vertices) = (the length of base's vertices) * 600) reporting "The rain cloud omitted drops"
require condition ((part's material's unlit) and ((part's material's depth write = false) and (part's casts shadow = false))) reporting "Rain changed the scene lighting or opaque depth"
require condition ((part's material's opacity = 0.6) and (part's material's flags = (3 as a 32 bit unsigned integer))) reporting "Rain lost its shared shader effect material"
require condition (refresh website Farm weather weather at amount 1.0) reporting "Rain did not become visible"
require condition ((refresh website Farm weather weather at amount 0.5) = false) reporting "Changing rain strength rebuilt geometry"
set bank to a UI scene mesh bank
set frame to a UI scene frame using bank
set camera to a UI scene camera at (a UI scene vector from [12.0,18.0,15.0]) aimed at (a UI scene vector from [0.0,0.4,0.0]) with angle 35.0 aspect 1.0 near 0.1 far 150.0
set objects to an empty list of a pointer to UI scene object
append (weather's object) to objects
prepare UI scene frame frame from objects through camera
require condition (((the length of frame's records) = 1) and ((the length of frame's draws) = 1)) reporting "Rain must use one mesh draw instead of per-drop submissions"
require condition ((the length of frame's shadow records) = 0) reporting "Rain was submitted to the shadow pass"
require condition ((the length of bank's spans) = 1) reporting "Rain duplicated its mesh storage"
require condition (refresh website Farm weather weather at amount 0.0) reporting "Clear skies did not hide rain"
free objects
close UI scene frame frame
close UI scene mesh bank bank
close website Farm weather weather
require condition ((the length of (landscape's objects)) = count) reporting "Closing rain retained its scene object"
close website Farm landscape landscape
free website farm world world
print line "Farm rain uses one retained cloud, shader motion, fading opacity and no shadow, picking or per-drop draw overhead."
